{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>飛日本又有必買手信！日本人氣朱古力品牌 ROYCE 特別推出全新限量版「法式焦糖燉蛋生朱古力」，朱古力特別採用雙層設計，將香醇濃郁的雲尼拿，與帶有微微苦甜感的焦糖風味層完美重疊，最後在表面撒上細緻可可粉。特別加入高級蘭姆酒「Mount Gay XO Triple Cask Blend」，甘甜香濃的焦糖與奶油香氣隨即散開，甜品控不能錯過！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178922883699877559_4568865166aa5772584dbe.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178922883886314401_372279086aa57727e8c38.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178922884195280092_12587713286aa5772a6b91e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178922884405572577_7473322676aa5772cd31a7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178922884605298263_11662789696aa5772ec2f38.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178922884817075796_2568918346aa5773161b93.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T16:18:19.473085+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":240,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}